# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:67
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_61479d0c:

    # "Opening the flap of her tent, I stepped inside to find Ves sitting cross legged on the floor, inspecting her axes before sharpening them with a vicious-looking rock."
    "Abrindo a aba de sua tenda, entrei para encontrar Ves sentada de pernas cruzadas no chão, inspecionando seus machados antes de afiá-los com uma pedra de aparência feroz."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:68
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_80992f0b:

    # "Looking around the tent which flapped with each gust of wind, I observed that she had done a remarkable job to have survived as long as she had out here in these harsh lands."
    "Olhando ao redor da tenda que balançava a cada rajada de vento, observei que ela havia feito um trabalho notável para ter sobrevivido tanto tempo aqui nestas terras hostis."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:69
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_2c9aacee:

    # "Sprawled across the floor were a mixture of fur rugs made from the hides of animals from her many hunts and cloth she had found and hung decoratively."
    "Espalhados pelo chão havia uma mistura de tapetes de pele feitos de couros de animais de suas muitas caçadas e tecido que ela havia encontrado e pendurado decorativamente."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:70
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_80cc8164:

    # "Here and there were various pieces of equipment and intricate looking items she had fashioned out here in this small corner of the desert."
    "Aqui e ali havia vários pedaços de equipamento e itens de aparência intricada que ela havia fabricado aqui neste pequeno canto do deserto."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:71
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_63e642cd:

    # "There was a small wooden tub, presumably for washing in but I couldn’t even begin to guess where she managed to find enough water to get close to filling it in these barren lands."
    "Havia uma pequena banheira de madeira, presumivelmente para se lavar, mas eu não conseguia nem começar a adivinhar onde ela conseguia encontrar água suficiente para quase enchê-la nestas terras áridas."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:72
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_03f711ff:

    # "Her bed was comprised of a cluster of blue quilts and pillows that seemed almost out of place in the desert, had she stolen them?"
    "Sua cama era composta por um aglomerado de colchas e travesseiros azuis que pareciam quase fora de lugar no deserto, será que ela os tinha roubado?"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:73
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_f29e70bc:

    # "The bedframe itself was notably made with some craftsmanship, further raising my suspicions on the matter, but I decided not to pry too much into her affairs."
    "A estrutura da cama em si era notavelmente feita com algum artesanato, aumentando ainda mais minhas suspeitas sobre o assunto, mas decidi não me intrometer muito em seus assuntos."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:74
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_6e5075fc:

    # "Here and there were jars filled with either water or small dead animals in some preservative substance, scorpions, beetles and such..."
    "Aqui e ali havia jarros cheios de água ou pequenos animais mortos em alguma substância preservativa, escorpiões, besouros e tal..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:75
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_df6a8060:

    # "Presumably kept as small rations of food for when the dried-out meat on the lines outside was running low."
    "Presumivelmente mantidos como pequenas rações de comida para quando a carne seca nas cordas lá fora estivesse acabando."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:76
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_f16dfa89:

    # "As she tested the sharpness of her axe with her thumb, she looked up coolly at me."
    "Enquanto ela testava o fio de seu machado com o polegar, ela olhou friamente para mim."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:77
translate ptBR ves_firstmeet_2252db6b:

    # VES @ talk "What do you want, human?"
    VES @ talk "O que você quer, humano?"

